# Mentipy: the virtualenv PythonTeX runs in and the generated QR assets.
# The question store, mentipy.json, is committed: it holds the students'
# answers (a timestamp and the answer, nothing that identifies anyone),
# and a commit ties them to the version of the slides they answered.
.venv/
mentipy-obj/
